@startuml
title UML State Machine Diagram - Healthcare Portal

[*] --> Registration

state "Registration" as Registration
state "Failed Registration" as FailedRegistration
state "Signed In" as SignedIn
state "Access Denied" as AccessDenied
state "Facilities" as Facilities
state "News and Expert Content" as NewsExpertContent
state "Health Information" as HealthInformation
state "Result Viewed" as ResultViewed
state "Payment Process" as PaymentProcess
state "Insurance Validation" as InsuranceValidation
state "Doctor Consultation" as DoctorConsultation
state "Drug and Supplement Purchase" as DrugSupplementPurchase

Registration --> FailedRegistration : registration fails
FailedRegistration --> AccessDenied : access denied due to failed registration

SignedIn --> Facilities : signed in successfully
Facilities --> NewsExpertContent : navigate to news and expert content
NewsExpertContent --> HealthInformation : navigate to health information
HealthInformation --> ResultViewed : view result of fitness checking or symptom check
ResultViewed --> PaymentProcess : proceed with payment for services
PaymentProcess --> InsuranceValidation : validate insurance for available finance-related services
InsuranceValidation --> DoctorConsultation : process and validate insurance for doctor consultations
DoctorConsultation --> DrugSupplementPurchase : complete payment process for doctor consultation

DrugSupplementPurchase --> SignedIn : select payment method (cash or insurance)
SignedIn --> PaymentProcess : inform user about cash payment details if chosen as the payment method
PaymentProcess --> InsuranceValidation : complete payment process for insurance-based payments

InsuranceValidation --> PaymentProcess : collect user feedback after service completion
PaymentProcess --> AccessDenied : log out users at the end of their session

AccessDenied --> [*]

@enduml
